==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A feeling of [[nausea]], [[dizziness]] etc. caused by the motion of an [[aircraft]]; a form of [[motion sickness]].

====I never eat breakfast, lunch or dinner before a flight because I don't want to puke on the way to the airport because I know I'm about to get on a plane. If I had just eaten breakfast during a trip and Mom asked, "Are you ready to go to the airport?" and I had been unaware that it was plane ride day, then I'm sure I would have to yell, "PULL OVER!!" like a cop would in order to step out of the car to throw up. That's why I must know the exact dates and times that we fly to a destination and fly back home so that there's no preemptive airsickness before boarding the plane.====
* [[motion sickness]]

